{"id":"n62363-1-21","stage":0,"title":"넘어지다 · 跌倒","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62363-1-21-1","ko":"왜 이렇게 균형이 안 맞지?","zh":"怎么这么不平衡？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"균형이","meaning":"平衡，均衡","explanation":"균형：平衡，均衡；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"균형","audio":"/audio/634269a095ddb1b1dd57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37056","senseId":"1","lemma":"균형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞지?","meaning":"相称，对，和谐","explanation":"맞다：相称，对，和谐；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"8","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"634269a095ddb1b1","term":"균형","zh":"平衡，均衡","audio":"/audio/634269a095ddb1b1dd57.mp3","entryId":"37056","definition":"不倾向或不偏重任何一方的状态。","pronunciation":["균형"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"相称，对，和谐","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"某种行动、意见或状况等与其它对象不违背而相配。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b4c0c06ef06f2824cd3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62363-1-21-2","ko":"잘못했다가는 책장이 뒤로 넘어지겠다.","zh":"一不小心书架就要向后倒了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘못했다가는","meaning":"弄不好","explanation":"잘못하다：弄不好；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"3","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책장이","meaning":"书柜","explanation":"책장：书柜；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책장","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78697","senseId":"1","lemma":"책장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒤로","meaning":"后，后面","explanation":"뒤：后，后面；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘어지겠다.","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"弄不好","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"事情不顺或运气不好。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]},{"id":"0aedd7a678ca8a1d","term":"책장","zh":"书柜","audio":"/audio/0aedd7a678ca8a1d1244.mp3","entryId":"78697","definition":"存放书籍的柜子。","pronunciation":["책짱"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，后面","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"朝向的反方向。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒"